A||||3||Formula88||Weird howling noise?||||5||
Z||000000||Formula88||10-10-2001||10:32 PM||||Ok, I just replaced the heater core on my Formula.  Everything seems fine except I now get a strange howling noise from about 4000rpms up.  I thought it might be air in the coolant system, so I burped the system (I also filled the core and then plugged it before putting it in the car - removing the plugs to put the hoses on).  <P>So, possible still an air pocket?  I get plenty of heat and the cars temp runs exactly like it always has.  The heater hoses were about 1" shorter than stock, but there was enough slack to put them on.  Could pulling the hoses taught cause it?  The sounds appears to be coming from the engine compartment, and if I had to guess, I suspect it's coming from the water pump.  The noise started exactly when I swapped the core.  I may go bypass the core again to see if the noise disappears.<P>Anyone experience this?  Even so, this was the easiest heater core to replace I've ever seen!  I love how easy Fiero's are to work on!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||5
Z||000001||JetroGT||10-11-2001||12:28 AM||||I had a howling noise on my SE. It was bad Bearings on the rear wheels. They are sealed and overpriced.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Alex4mula||10-11-2001||08:17 AM||||Maybe Murphys law. When I fixed two vacuum lines 3 weeks ago my fuel pump died. What a f&^%#g coincidence. Could be WP or wheel bearing. Never heard about a Fiero howling by lack of refrigerant in the system. Maybe because Halloween is approaching  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000003||Formula88||10-11-2001||03:23 PM||||Well, it's definately not a wheel bearing.  The sounds is relative to engine rpm - regardless of vehicle speed.  The refrigerant was not touched.  I replaced the heater core, but didn't touch the A/C lines.  Both A/C and heater work perfectly.  I figured if it was air pockets in the coolant system, that my car would overheat or the heater wouldn't be as efficient.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">||||reg||1
